Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "admin@site.com",
    "password": "admin123"
}

### Création d'un nouveau ticket par un utilisateur 
POST http://localhost:3000/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser}}

{
    "title": "Premier ticket",
    "description": "Voici le premier ticket", 
    "status": "open",
    "createdAt": "2025-04-13"
}

### Création d'un nouveau ticket par un technicien 
POST http://localhost:3000/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenTech}}

{
    "title": "Deuxieme ticket",
    "description": "Voici le deuxieme ticket", 
    "status": "open",
    "createdAt": "2025-04-13"
}

